msgid ""
"We use git to compare the known versions from package to the git tags, as "
"well as any git tags that are SEMVER versions, and find the latest known "
"version prior to the commit, as well as the distance from that version to "
"the commit in the git repo. Those values are used to compare Version objects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../_spack_root/lib/spack/spack/version/git_ref_lookup.py:docstring of
