#: ../../../_spack_root/lib/spack/spack/version/version_types.py:docstring of
#: spack.version.version_types.VersionStrComponent:9
msgid ""
"For speed, Spack versions are designed to map to Python tuples, so that we "
"can use Python's fast lexicographic tuple comparison on them. "
"``VersionStrComponent`` is designed to work as a component in these version "
"tuples, and as such must compare directly with ``int`` or other "
